  "solution": {
    "text": "The ball will be vertical at the highest point so<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.(1)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ta</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&hellip;&nbsp;. .(2)<br /><br />Squaring and adding equation (1) &amp; equation (2), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">u</mtext><mtext>cos</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">u</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
